    "text": "Part A: Mortgage Loan Representations and Warranties with respect to Group 1 Mortgage Loans: (A) Payments Current. Except as set forth on the Mortgage Loan Schedule, (i) all payments required to be made up to the Closing Date for the Mortgage Loan under the terms of the Mortgage Note, other than payments not yet 30 days Delinquent, have been made and credited, (ii) no payment required under the Mortgage Loan has been 30 days or more Delinquent at any time since the origination of the Mortgage Loan, and (iii) the first Monthly Payment was made with respect to the Mortgage Loan on its related Due Date or within the grace period, all in accordance with the terms of the related Mortgage Note;"
